[Name] Zstd
[Summary] Fast real-time compression library and CLI (libzstd + zstd)
[Description] Zstandard is a fast lossless compression algorithm. Provides libzstd.so + libzstd.pc, which Mesa 25.3.6 probes as an optional feature (meson.options 'zstd', auto) and uses for compressed shader cache entries (HAVE_ZSTD). Pinned to the ISO's own version 1.4.4 so making the dependency explicit does not upgrade the base system.
